Dex: Sky's button. "FREE NIBBLES," with a tiny hamster raising a tiny fist.
===
title: Item_bones_lab_coat_Look
---
Dex: Mr. Bones' lab coat. The name tag still says "MR. BONES, TEACHING ASSISTANT." I'll just keep my thumb over it.
===
title: Item_dot_mop_head_Look
---
Dex: A grey string mop head from Dot's cart. Faintly lemon-scented. Held under the chin, it's a very distinguished beard.
===
title: Item_prof_disguise_Look
---
Dex: One lab coat and one mop-head beard. Together they make Professor Dex Dooley, Department of Hamster Studies.
